   "en": "Dummy",
   "uk": "Dummy",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_E24320100_IIDA_001_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "...And so I really need some money[n]right now.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_E24320100_IIDA_001_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Can you tell me about this[n]easy part-time job? I'm sure you[n]know about it, Iida-kun. Please!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_E24320100_IIDA_002_0#0",
   "speaker": "Iida",
   "en": "......",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_E24320100_IIDA_002_0#1",
   "speaker": "Iida",
   "en": "You don't need my help. A girl[n]like you could probably get a[n]job anywhere, right?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_E24320100_IIDA_003_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Huh!?",
   "uk": "Га!?",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_E24320100_IIDA_003_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Um... Now that you mention it... Yes.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_E24320100_IIDA_003_0#2",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "So, um... What I mean is...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_E24320100_IIDA_004_0#0",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "This is going south fast.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_E24320100_IIDA_005_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "O-Oh, François!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_E24320100_IIDA_006_0#0",
   "speaker": "Iida",
   "en": "Huh?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_E24320100_IIDA_007_0#0",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "Huh?",
   "uk": "Га?",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_E24320100_IIDA_008_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "M-My cat François got run over by[n]a car... and also has an incurable[n]illness! I need money fast!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_E24320100_IIDA_009_0#0",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "That's not convincing at all...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_E24320100_IIDA_009_0#1",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "Is she talking about me?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_E24320100_IIDA_010_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "I-If François were to die, I think[n]I'd die too! Probably...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_E24320100_IIDA_011_0#0",
   "speaker": "Iida",
   "en": "Come on, don't talk like that...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_E24320100_IIDA_012_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "If you don't like it, then tell me[n]about that easy part-time job.",
