   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_E24320100_IIDA_012_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "You know something, don't you?[n]I've heard the rumors.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_E24320100_IIDA_013_0#0",
   "speaker": "Iida",
   "en": "Rumors!?",
