   "id": "MSG_E24320100_IIDA_017_0#0",
   "speaker": "Iida",
   "en": "That's...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_E24320100_IIDA_018_0#0",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "She actually got the momentum back.[n]She's not acting anymore now, is she?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_E24320100_IIDA_018_0#1",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "Come on, let's leave this guy to[n]Lady Ann and go look for that[n]Nishiyama fellow.",
